Subject: [PATCH 1/3] w1/slaves: use pr_* instead of printk
Date: Thu, 19 Jun 2014 02:51:59 +0200
Message-Id: <1403139121-2431-2-git-send-email-fjodor.schelichow@hotmail.com>
